WEBVTT

00:06:27.344 --> 00:06:30.118
made of stone or concrete.

00:06:30.142 --> 00:06:32.008
And the question is,

00:06:32.032 --> 00:06:33.424
if one inhabits that space,

00:06:33.448 --> 00:06:36.786
what is the material of the Mall?

00:06:36.810 --> 00:06:39.434
It has to be different
from the buildings there.

00:06:39.458 --> 00:06:41.458
It has to be something entirely different.

00:06:41.482 --> 00:06:43.246
It has to be air.

00:06:43.270 --> 00:06:45.768
In our imagination, it has to be light.

00:06:45.792 --> 00:06:47.983
It has to be ephemeral.
It has to be formless.

00:06:48.007 --> 00:06:50.007
And it has to be free.

00:06:50.031 --> 00:06:53.541
(Video)